  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> must be continuous and differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br />For continuity at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math> &hellip;. <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />For differentiability at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>9</mn> <mo>&#8722;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>9</mn> <mo>+</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>23</mn></mfrac></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>46</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></math>",
